 "issues": [
  {
   "id": "V1",
   "path": "sections.limits.1",
   "category": "interpretation_label",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "The paragraph opens with a hedged, labeled reading: 作者认为…未必改变了廉颇的脾气. It then closes with an unlabeled, definite verdict: 它也没有把一个人从此改写 / 'it did not rewrite the man from that day on'. The evidence only records later events (the attack on Le Cheng, the flight to Wei, the retainers' remark). Whether the apology changed his temper is the author's inference and should not be stated as settled fact in a kind=record paragraph.",
   "evidence": [
    {
     "id": "L-E16",
     "quote": "廉頗怒，攻樂乘，樂乘走。廉頗遂奔魏之大梁。"
    },
    {
     "id": "L-E15",
     "quote": "天下以市道交"
    }
   ],
   "proposed": "Change the zh ending to '……见于本篇《史记》记载，但一种解释是，它未必把一个人从此改写。' Change the en ending to '…recorded in this chapter of the Shiji, though on one reading it need not have rewritten the man from that day on.'"
  },
  {
   "id": "V2",
   "path": "uncertainty_note",
   "category": "interpretation_label",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "The zh note says inferences are marked with “一种解释是”“作者推断”. The label 作者推断 does not appear anywhere in the piece. The labels actually used are 作者认为, 作者解释, 作者提示 and 作者提出, and limits.0 also gives 作者认为. The note misdescribes the piece's own labeling.",
   "evidence": [],
   "proposed": "Change “作者推断” to “作者认为” so the note matches limits.0 and the text. The en wording 'the author's inference' can stay or become 'the author's view'."
  },
  {
   "id": "V3",
   "path": "sections.analysis.1",
   "category": "style",
   "severity": "note",
   "problem": "The labels pile up: 一种解释是 appears twice in a row, and the second sentence also carries a parenthetical （作者解释）. The en text mirrors this with 'On one reading… One reading is… (the author's interpretation)'. The labeling is correct but clumsy.",
   "evidence": [],
   "proposed": "Merge the last two interpretive sentences under a single 一种解释是 / 'One reading is' and drop the trailing （作者解释） / '(the author's interpretation)'."
  }
 ],
 "overall": "所有原文引语均逐字出自证据，史实、时序与中英对应基本无误。需修两处标注问题：limits.1 结尾把推断写成定论；uncertainty_note 所列标注词“作者推断”与正文不符。另有一处纯文风提示（analysis.1 标注重复），修订后可发。"
}